---
---

<section id="projects" class="py-24 max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12">
  <div class="mb-12 reveal">
    <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-[4px] text-[var(--text-muted)]">
      Featured Projects & Homelabs
    </span>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-16">
    
    <!-- Project 1: VULN-INTELLIGEN -->
    <div class="cyber-frame p-6 sm:p-10 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center reveal reveal-d1">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
        <div>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[var(--text-muted)] uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">Final-Year Research Project</span>
          <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase tracking-tight">VULN-INTELLIGEN</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-body)] leading-relaxed">
            The VULN-INTELLIGEN project demonstrates that context-aware, AI-driven triage is no longer a luxury, but a necessity for modern cybersecurity operations. By transitioning from a static "Global Base" metric (CVSS) to a "Localized Tactical Priority" score, the system empowers security teams to cut through alert fatigue and focus exclusively on threats that pose a demonstrable risk to their specific infrastructure.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-body)] leading-relaxed">
            The successful integration of the DistilBERT inference engine with the "Intelligence Trinity" (NVD, CISA KEV, and MITRE ATT&CK) creates a comprehensive evaluation pipeline. Combined with the automated generation of executive PDF briefs and actionable mitigation playbooks, VULN-INTELLIGEN provides a highly effective, production-ready blueprint for the future of AI-augmented Security Operations Centers (SOCs).
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <a href="https://github.com/MugerwaElijah-lab" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-block px-5 py-2.5 bg-[var(--text-primary)] text-[var(--bg-canvas)] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform">
            Project Repo ➔
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-[var(--border-frame)] bg-[var(--bg-elevated)] group">
          <img src="/vuln-project preview.png" alt="VULN-INTELLIGEN Preview" class="w-full h-auto object-cover cursor-pointer project-preview transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Project 2: C.A.S.P.E.R. -->
    <div class="cyber-frame p-6 sm:p-10 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center reveal reveal-d2">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
        <div>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[var(--text-muted)] uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">Personal Security & Knowledge AI</span>
          <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase tracking-tight">C.A.S.P.E.R.</h3>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-body)] leading-relaxed">
          Central Assistant for Strategic Priorities & Expert Response — A fully local, voice-controlled AI orchestration layer for semantic knowledge management.
        </p>

        <div class="pl-4 border-l-2 border-[var(--text-primary)] space-y-3 font-mono text-xs text-[var(--text-body)]">
          <div><strong class="text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase tracking-wider block sm:inline mr-2">Situation:</strong> Obsidian vault grew into a dense, unstructured knowledge base requiring semantic retrieval without cloud APIs.</div>
          <div><strong class="text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase tracking-wider block sm:inline mr-2">Task:</strong> Build a fully local, voice‑controlled AI assistant for RAG search, interlinked note creation, and automated morning briefs.</div>
          <div><strong class="text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase tracking-wider block sm:inline mr-2">Action:</strong> Designed a Flask bridge connecting Ollama and Langflow; integrated Open WebUI tools and Twilio WhatsApp gateway via ngrok.</div>
          <div><strong class="text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase tracking-wider block sm:inline mr-2">Result:</strong> A $0/month local assistant with zero data leaks, enabling note creation in under 3 minutes.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {["Python", "Flask", "Ollama", "RAG", "REST API"].map(tag => (
            <span class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] px-2.5 py-1 bg-[var(--bg-elevated)] border border-[var(--border-subtle)] text-[var(--text-muted)] uppercase tracking-wide">
              {tag}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-[var(--border-frame)] bg-[var(--bg-elevated)] group">
          <img src="/C.A.S.P.E.R.png" alt="C.A.S.P.E.R. Preview" class="w-full h-auto object-cover cursor-pointer project-preview transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>



  </div>
</section>
